    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Decopins 2&quot; is a sequel to &quot;Decopins&quot; a Decopin-type tower defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use traditional Japanese finger flick -Decopins- to repel the approaching donuts and prevent them from escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the cafe has been renovated, and in addition to the donuts, hamburgers also try to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use decopin and magic to prevent the bastards from breaking defense lines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, It will be tougher... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect EXP and money to level up your Decopins. Depending on your level, you will also be able to use magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can enjoy simple operations, mainly using the mouse and keyboard. <br>*Implemented settings for adjusting the volume of BGM and SE.  <br>*you can use charge attacks.  <br>*It also has a snipe mode to decopin donuts in the distance.  <br>*We have 1-min Decopins challenge(available after clearing Stage 7).  <br>*Please handle your mouse with care.  <br>*Please refrain from using Decopin and magic in the real world.  <br>*You can enjoy Decopins2 even if you haven't played Decopins1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would like to thank everyone who played the Decopins series, everyone who created wonderful music and sound effects, everyone who created 3D assets, and UE4.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Decopins 2&quot; is a sequel to &quot;Decopins&quot; a Decopin-type tower defense game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use traditional Japanese finger flick -Decopins- to repel the approaching donuts and prevent them from escaping.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, the cafe has been renovated, and in addition to the donuts, hamburgers also try to escape.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use decopin and magic to prevent the bastards from breaking defense lines. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This time, It will be tougher... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect EXP and money to level up your Decopins. Depending on your level, you will also be able to use magic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*You can enjoy simple operations, mainly using the mouse and keyboard. <br>*Implemented settings for adjusting the volume of BGM and SE.  <br>*you can use charge attacks.  <br>*It also has a snipe mode to decopin donuts in the distance.  <br>*We have 1-min Decopins challenge(available after clearing Stage 7).  <br>*Please handle your mouse with care.  <br>*Please refrain from using Decopin and magic in the real world.  <br>*You can enjoy Decopins2 even if you haven't played Decopins1.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We would like to thank everyone who played the Decopins series, everyone who created wonderful music and sound effects, everyone who created 3D assets, and UE4.</p>",
    "short_description": "&quot;Decopins 2&quot; is a sequel to &quot;Decopins&quot; a Decopin-type tower defense shooting game. Use traditional Japanese finger flick -Decopin- to repel the approaching donuts. Collect EXP and money to level up your Decopins. Depending on your level, you will also be able to use magic. This time, it's tougher...",
